# Transitions
@scenario tutorial_lesson_05
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip guide wave]
pip: Watch the window as the scene fades and its lighting changes.
[if !tutorial_still]
[transition fade 380]
[endif]
[stage dusk]
pip: Change the fade duration and replay the transition.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
pip: Which value changes how long the fade lasts?
> The duration in milliseconds. -> correct
> The number of dialogue lines. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show pip guide curious]
pip: Timing belongs to the transition, so the script can keep its pacing. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip guide cheer]
pip: Timing belongs to the transition, so the script can keep its pacing.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_05]
[flag tutorial_done_05]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_2]
